                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Here we parse the JSON object to get the value of the parameters we are interested in.
By default, our scene includes five spheres so we check if we find five sliders corresponding to them.

In case we find null values, we replace them with a default radius value for the corresponding sphere.</item>
